1224342\",\"Henry Yuen\",null,[[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWTzUfp0qeFElECjV7_CQBmlmoSVKzjRNF9d6Xb9mhoP5cXWv8\"]],true],[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Yq7oyNIvAAkuc69fG51sbAQS4otJxbObbt3xdr8tXxXyUdq4tVGtfgeKuptveGdP1srxaHVrNPzOYcfaEQ\"]]],\"3.41.3\",null,null,null,[true,false],null,2],[\"841d3ffc-d5b5-48a1-8446-39ff1db69217\",[\"Kevin Chan\",[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWngRYzn9O_AEmBPyXMowq97qe62W_xpLFOFe1JpvVSVQ82mx_z\"]]],1,null,\"It seems those at HSBC have decided if someone has hacked into your a/c \\u0026 able to mess with your funds, they will deny their ability to take screenshots to \\\"protect\\\" you, in the process also denying you the rightful owner the right to take snapshots of your various a/c balances, transfers, and stock trading. Such reasoning is absolutely ludicrous \\u0026 I'm seriously considering taking my business elsewhere.\",[1701684914,352000000],27,null,null,[\"115726088844329413918\",\"Kevin Chan\",null,[[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWngRYzn9O_AEmBPyXMowq97qe62W_xpLFOFe1JpvVSVQ82mx_z\"]],true],[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Yq7oyNIvAAkuc69fG51sbAQS4otJxbObbt3xdr8tXxXyUdq4tVGtfgeKuptveGdP1srxaHVrNPzOYcfaEQ\"]]],\"3.41.3\",null,null,null,[true,false],null,1],[\"5119a1c8-fec1-4f72-b60a-9856b7d0bf3a\",[\"Yuk Hei Leung\",[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIp2yPHONw1_azPU7srTq1_sDDprCuWY-kuGQUuqFoxYE3J2w\\u003dmo\"]]],1,null,\"Still doesn't work on Xiaomi fold for the last two version. Please fix asap. Or let user use the older versions\",[1701678914,614000000],5,null,null,[\"106041313727187256218\",\"Yuk Hei Leung\",null,[[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIp2yPHONw1_azPU7srTq1_sDDprCuWY-kuGQUuqFoxYE3J2w\\u003dmo\"]],true],[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleuser