e app versus going to the counter/using a PC is that you can no longer print a pdf or actual paper copy of the transaction details for my record. At least on a mobile i could screenshot the details for my records. NOT ANY MORE. The app has instituted a ridiculous policy of not being able to screenshot...so now i cant keep records of my transactions apart from the vague and detail lacking statement which is quite frankly ridiculous.\",[1701206723,934000000],80,null,null,[\"115754038442867441049\",\"Jeffrey Vella\",null,[[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJIJNU3ZhUc5YAajabBV4K4ptIzyzbuocoEUtZanrRQAj7CBg\\u003dmo\"]],true],[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Yq7oyNIvAAkuc69fG51sbAQS4otJxbObbt3xdr8tXxXyUdq4tVGtfgeKuptveGdP1srxaHVrNPzOYcfaEQ\"]]],\"3.40.10\",null,null,null,null,null,1],[\"a3d5868a-1293-412c-aa58-036e00d17e1c\",[\"W Lee\",[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKbGGre6iSaKW9saFlrLZBdb-7ia-KQupPJ8F4VA0FV5dIbcg\\u003dmo\"]]],5,null,\"Kylie was very patient and helped me sort out my problem.\",[1701202651,699000000],0,null,null,[\"100023079381480794418\",\"W Lee\",null,[[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKbGGre6iSaKW9saFlrLZBdb-7ia-KQupPJ8F4VA0FV5dIbcg\\u003dmo\"]],true],[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Yq7oyNIvAAkuc69fG51sbAQS4otJxbObbt3xdr8tXxXyUdq4tVGtfgeKuptveGdP1srxaHVrNPzOYcfaEQ\"]]],\"3.40.10\",null,null,null,null,null,1],[\"6d5f2d8c-a673-4b17-9bf1-f7b722a983f6\",[\"J Lam\",[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKuOiHDFQtYDKBHqkisl1cIJnQSH1q20fB2Ov7KSknkxl-bOA\\u003dmo\"]]],1,null,\"Crazy app is down for a bank!\",[1701184907,366000000],0,null,null,[\"114788194310711079095\",\"J Lam\",null,[[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKuOiHDFQtYDKBHqkisl1cIJnQSH1q20fB2Ov7KSknkxl-bOA\\u003dmo\"]],true],[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Yq7oyNIvAAkuc69fG51sbAQS4otJxbObbt3xdr8tXxXyUdq4tVGtfgeKuptveGdP1srxaHVrNPzOYcfaEQ\"]]],\"3.38.0\",null,null,null,null,null,2],[\"c3667a2d-c195-4d63-a1bb-28983e08c7c0\",[\"Rachel Lai\",[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUCxajwkXuEwelf1ZSu-p8WhZqhqwDdUhqfSwENxxr2ZsuOZIHH1A\"]]],1,null,\"Not sure who thought it's wise to change the app such that screenshots are disabled, when most online businesses that can be paid via FPS requires a screenshot of the transaction. 🤯 At least be smart enough to make a download image button... Security is important but perhaps customer needs could be factored in as well in future updates.\",[1701181195,839000000],6,null,null,[\"110566649278729962469\",\"Rachel Lai\",null,[[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUCxajwkXuEwelf1ZSu-p8WhZqhqwDdUhqfSwENxxr2ZsuOZIHH1A\"]],true],[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Yq7oyNIvAAkuc69fG51sbAQS4otJxbObbt3xdr8tXxXyUdq4tVGtfgeKuptveGdP1srxaHVrNPzOYcfaEQ\"]]],\"3.40.10\",null,null,null,[true,false],null,1],[\"a6ebbaad-2f36-4d87-8dcd-c4ca5272f484\",[\"Wyteshadow W\",[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWQrEfzk_wbGbaHWrUiBFpgJ-BoxnXmvE6-CpDRMtXwzaAltGxTvg\"]]],1,null,\"Updated the App, then on unable to launch in Android mobile phone. Customer service unable to solve past 1 week. Sigh!\",[1701147621,415000000],4,null,null,[\"112641568029006246215\",\"Wyteshadow W\",null,[[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWQrEfzk_wbGbaHWrUiBFpgJ-BoxnXmvE6-CpDRMtXwzaAltGxTvg\"]],true],[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Yq7oyNIvAAkuc69fG51sbAQS4otJxbObbt3xdr8tXxXyUdq4tVGtfgeKuptveGdP1srxaHVrNPzOYcfaEQ\"]]],\"3.40.10\",null,null,null,[true,false],null,1],[\"d88f1d77-9d54-428b-a4ae-37170effee91\",[\"kevin chan\",[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWzh3zMT