ore ridiculous user unfriendly features in the name of security.\",[1700714635,807000000],8,null,null,[\"104117388836873539187\",\"Elsa Lee\",null,[[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWY_zkHAaCeLerCUHhpbc_PRdIq1ctTzO8tbuKgFw4A64pYo4JS\"]],true],[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Yq7oyNIvAAkuc69fG51sbAQS4otJxbObbt3xdr8tXxXyUdq4tVGtfgeKuptveGdP1srxaHVrNPzOYcfaEQ\"]]],\"3.40.10\",null,null,null,null,null,1],[\"c69fff76-a50d-4648-afa7-a2ad1357a6dd\",[\"J\",[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLoYLLyUcbEvkyxlvS2fnwV71a83_jHsikFfQMTGYTm38E_8g\\u003dmo\"]]],1,null,\"Doesn't work with Android with the last version\",[1700711092,612000000],2,null,null,[\"100322772698441993809\",\"J\",null,[[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLoYLLyUcbEvkyxlvS2fnwV71a83_jHsikFfQMTGYTm38E_8g\\u003dmo\"]],true],[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Yq7oyNIvAAkuc69fG51sbAQS4otJxbObbt3xdr8tXxXyUdq4tVGtfgeKuptveGdP1srxaHVrNPzOYcfaEQ\"]]],\"3.40.10\",null,null,null,null,null,2],[\"757c3fa8-ebe0-4de6-b9d0-2d587f44ebb6\",[\"eric chow\",[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXX0lO_0B8vn0kpfbNeXiGO8KcdLBwEZXq8nnKHeJP0y_FOcXU\"]]],5,null,\"新的更新後，app icon 消失了 但在app store上能open\",[1700710338,691000000],0,null,null,[\"117978421314318371025\",\"eric chow\",null,[[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXX0lO_0B8vn0kpfbNeXiGO8KcdLBwEZXq8nnKHeJP0y_FOcXU\"]],true],[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Yq7oyNIvAAkuc69fG51sbAQS4otJxbObbt3xdr8tXxXyUdq4tVGtfgeKuptveGdP1srxaHVrNPzOYcfaEQ\"]]],\"3.40.10\",null,null,null,[true,false],null,1],[\"fead878f-77c5-4ebf-8761-c5cead9f75eb\",[\"Junxing KE\",[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWWm7i1kNso5_8moWSWaL3ZQN2cAF3WySttN96aSCJfTPIKiUI4\"]]],1,null,\"小米11ultra上，更新到3.40.10后，app闪退，重启重装